WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:03,510
son

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,250
Where did you say you hid the treasure?

3
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:11,550
the most dangerous place

4
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:21,560
It's the safest place, nothing goes wrong

5
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:23,780
It’s been a tiring day for everyone

6
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:33,440
Go back and rest. Lock the door.

7
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,260
Yaqin, this is me Zhang Jianguo

8
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:39,620
You are such a dog that you can't change your eating habits. What's wrong with me? Why are you saying this to me? Don't you know why?

9
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:41,580
I thought you had finally changed recently, but I didn’t expect it.

10
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,220
You touched Xiaoyue's room last night

11
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,180
Isn't it enough?

12
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,500
Why are you still looking for me now?

13
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:54,070
You looked for Liu Xiaoyue yesterday

14
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:55,030
Not satisfied yet?

15
00:00:55,150 --> 00:00:56,190
Why are you still looking for me?

16
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,020
I have no other meaning

17
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:03,180
I just want you to help me put on my medicine. I misunderstood him.

18
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,560
He didn't hear any other meaning, right?

19
00:01:07,330 --> 00:01:08,250
Then come in

20
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:10,460
Everyone is almost asleep

21
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:12,380
Otherwise, you should go to my room to bandage it.

22
00:01:29,630 --> 00:01:32,080
I don’t know who offended him again.

23
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,120
Go to your room and get down to business. I'll have something to do later.
